1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * 
2 CONT
2 CONT 11. 8/10 1725 [Vice-Pastor Finnø, Christiansands St., 17 Lars Christensen Hilmand el. Hillemand, f. Stavanger •/7 86; F. C. Lauritsen H., Kbmd.; M. Anna Sørensdtr. Hoffmann; St. Stavanger 05; C. 4/8 12, h.; p. Cap. Øiestad, Christ
