2 NICK Inger Jacobsdatter Sildpollnes
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1739
2 ADDR
3 CITY Haukøy
3 STAE Nordland
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE OCT 1807
2 PLAC Sildpollnes
